{
 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of 2-3 minutes: the launcher, Load ROM",
  "on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its",
  "line saying so is the one waited for), Start Game, then Enter (Start, and select in the menus: PaxDino's keys)",
  "through the boot screens and the title to the main menu, and through the menus' defaults as a player does, each",
  "press until the front end's screen moves on (tools/game_state.js): Multiplayer, one player, the first character, the",
  "default loadout (W, C-Up), one Down at level select (the first map, off the Gauntlet, which picks maps at random), the match's",
  "options (10 minutes, one novice bot) and the Rumble Pak notice. The match is a need that a match is on, and it is",
  "played 65 s of its own clock (matchTicks(), 15ths of a second) from when it starts, its fly-through included: about",
  "10 s at a time, walking out and back by as much (W and S), turning one way and back (the arrow keys) and firing (F),",
  "with shots about 3, 15, 40 and 65 s in."
